---
// About page: Call to action
---

<section id="about-cta" class="relative bg-dark-background py-16 lg:py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A1A1A] via-[#161616] to-[#0A0A0A]"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-[30px] lg:text-[38px] font-bold text-white font-serif mb-4 leading-tight">
      Ready to Put Our Experience to Work?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-200 text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[700px] mx-auto">
      Contact us today for a confidential consultation. We'll review your situation and help you understand your options.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="tel:+18016850552"
        class="inline-block bg-[#C1272D] text-white rounded-[6px] px-6 py-3 text-[16px] font-medium hover:bg-[#8F1A1F] transition"
      >Call (801) 685-0552</a>
      <a
        href="/contact-us"
        class="inline-block border border-white/40 text-white rounded-[6px] px-6 py-3 text-[16px] font-normal hover:bg-white/10 transition"
      >Send a Message</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
